{
  "$defs": {
    "SubjectAccountOut": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`GET /v1/accounts/subjects` 的 `subjects[].accounts[]`：一个渠道账号绑定。\n\n``revoked`` 是**派生字段**（``revoked_at`` 非空），只读接口不回吐时间戳：\n页面要说的是\"这个号还能不能用\"，不是\"哪一刻解绑的\"。",
      "properties": {
        "account_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Account Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "connector_instance": {
          "title": "Connector Instance",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "external_account_id": {
          "title": "External Account Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "proof": {
          "title": "Proof",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "revoked": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Revoked",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "const": "v1",
          "default": "v1",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "account_id",
        "connector_instance",
        "external_account_id",
        "proof"
      ],
      "title": "SubjectAccountOut",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SubjectRow": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个人：昵称、亲疏等级、被合并到谁，以及他/她绑定的账号。\n\n``merged_into`` 非空表示\"已被当作另一个人\"。合并**只写这一个指针**，\n账号与记忆都留在原处（所以拆开只是清指针）。",
      "properties": {
        "accounts": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/SubjectAccountOut"
          },
          "title": "Accounts",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "display_name": {
          "title": "Display Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "merged_into": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 128,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Merged Into"
        },
        "schema_version": {
          "const": "v1",
          "default": "v1",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "subject_id": {
          "maxLength": 128,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Subject Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "trust_level": {
          "title": "Trust Level",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "subject_id",
        "display_name",
        "trust_level"
      ],
      "title": "SubjectRow",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/SubjectsPage.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`GET /v1/accounts/subjects` 的响应（**分页**，docs/API-WEB-V1.md §13）。\n\n分页是契约的一部分，不是可选优化：``subjects`` 默认只有 50 条，\n调用方必须看 ``has_more`` / ``total``，不能假设\"一次就是全部\"。\n``total`` 是**筛选后**的总行数（``q`` 生效时它不是全表行数）。",
  "properties": {
    "has_more": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Has More",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "limit": {
      "default": 50,
      "maximum": 200,
      "minimum": 1,
      "title": "Limit",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "offset": {
      "default": 0,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Offset",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "q": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Q"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "v1",
      "default": "v1",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "subjects": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/SubjectRow"
      },
      "title": "Subjects",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "total": {
      "default": 0,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Total",
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "title": "SubjectsPage",
  "type": "object",
  "x-ling-schema-version": "v1"
}
